senses.gloss:
लोच् LOC, Ⅰ. Ā. -loca, [der. of √ ruc];
 🞄cs. P. -locaya. ā, consider, ponder;
 🞄cs. cause to see;
 consider, reflect, ponder: 🞄pp. ālocya. anu‿ā, cs. consider, 🞄reflect. pari‿ā, cs. id. nis, 🞄cs. gd. nirolocya, considering, reflecting.

लोचन loc-ana, a. illuminating;
 n. eye: 🞄-gocara, a. being within range of sight;
 🞄-traya-patha, m. range of (Śivaʼs) three 🞄eyes;
 -patha, m. sphere of vision;
 -paruṣa, 🞄a. gazing fiercely;
 -pāta, m. glance;
 -maya, 🞄a. (ī) consisting of eyes;
 -añcala, m. corner 🞄of the eye;
 -āpāta, m. glance;
 -uḍḍāraka, 🞄N. of a village;
 -utsa, N. of a locality.
